  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Bond length <math><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mtext> order</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>Bond length <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>no. of bonding </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mo>̄</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mtext>no. of antibonding </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mtext>e</mtext></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">̄</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>Bond orders of   <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mtext>,  </mtext><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mtext>, </mtext><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mtext> and </mtext><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi></math> are respectively 2.5, 1.5, 1 and 3 <br/><br/>Hence  <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>  is shortest in bond length as have max .bond order.",
